OL,3,GNEWSALincolnshire Police car crashes
OL,4,Acost force #200k
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrashes caused more than #200,000 of
OL,7,Fdamage to Lincolnshire Police cars in
OL,8,F2025.
OL,10,FPolice vehicles were involved in 177
OL,11,Fcrashes, data provided under a Freedom
OL,12,Fof Information Request showed.
OL,14,FThe force said damage to police
OL,15,Fvehicles was sometimes "unavoidable",
OL,16,Fparticularly in pursuits.
