OL,3,GNEWSALincolnshire Police car crashes
OL,4,Acost force #200k
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Jason Baxter said: "Sadly, we do
OL,7,Fhave occasions where an officer is
OL,8,Finjured or tragically killed. But the
OL,9,Fongoing training our officers receive
OL,10,Ffrom our training unit, which is of a
OL,11,Fnational standard, does everything it
OL,12,Fcan to reduce those possibilities."
